  "findings": [
    "Independently recomputed 712,248 raw-source/numeric/role assertions over 8,173 actual player-game rows and 94 original public response archives; separate 1,549 event-context assertions passed. Numeric audit imports no production calculation code.",
    "All 32 teams / 813 statistical players and 2,616 current roster identities match exact current primary source IDs/names/teams/positions. Reported rosters do not establish active game-day status.",
    "Live Week 5 DAL\u2013TB remains explicitly a provider snapshot; next scheduled Week 6 is separate. Partial live boxscores enter neither completed team/player windows nor confirmed QB starts.",
    "Every stale pre-event INACTIVE bulletin remains dated team information with null future-game/inactive applicability. Minimal updater guard prevents core-week advancement from inventing new game scope; 26 genuine regression tests passed with 235 current runtime files unchanged.",
    "Actual source disagreements remain explicit and affected values/rates unavailable: Ted Hurst targets 3 / 4,12 QB recap/source role conflicts, unavailable roles/jersey/status discrepancies. Missing appearances/statistics are not silently zero, DNP or older padded starts.",
    "QB start history uses explicit source roles and corroboration, including genuine previous seasons/opponents; Dak 5 versus Jalon 1 is unpadded. Derived NFL passer rating, sacks/dropbacks, scrambles/designed runs, target share/red-zone/deep-air-yard counters use source-complete denominators.",
    "Actual source dialogs retain relevant primary/secondary stat, snap, starter and PBP source links. Routes, pressure, blitz, weather, itinerary and complete official inactives remain unavailable when public evidence is absent.",
    "Both genuinely completed native engines load the exact raw b589 book. Each viewport passes 685 native inputs, 48 filter states, 232 dialogue destinations, 16 QB selections and unchanged/manual/correction/recovery behavior; all 32 routes were checked in the 393 scenario.",
    "All 26 final common WPE originals were personally viewed against approved chat renders; desktop initial 12/final and tablet final were also personally viewed. Dense paired cards, source labels, diamond controls and readably separated historical/live context are present."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "This specialist acceptance binds the exact current local application, source snapshot and completed native reports; it does not assert publication or hosted verification, which remain root release gates.",
