    "WPE 393 contains 13 navigation-cancelled resource requests during deliberate route changes, separately recorded; no JavaScript/console/HTTP/external/request-failure errors remained.",
    "Large-image missing-glyph impressions were explicitly retracted after six exact original-scale crops were personally viewed and independently RGBA-matched to original PNG rectangles; no raster/backend defect was established. Failed historical Chrome v6 and older-book audits remain preserved, never promoted to whole release acceptance."
